schema: "0.4"
id: trd-authoring-02-vr-radial-menu
type: image
quality: high

# therobotdrafts authoring UX — VR radial command menu mockup.
# Consumes: design-conventions §1.1/§2.1 + §6.2 parity + §6.3 comfort, Lena's
# verb glyph set + §B reserved UI channel (e94fe1b8), Yuki's radial flow (1085589f).

prompt:
  system: |
    You are a senior XR interaction designer rendering a high-fidelity mockup of
    a VR radial command menu inside a 3D "bubble" UML IDE viewed through a headset.
    Premium, calm, technical — not a game. First-person VR perspective: we see the
    user's controllers and a wrist-anchored radial menu floating over a field of
    packed-sphere code bubbles in a dark volumetric space.

    INVIOLABLE RULE: semantic color belongs ONLY to the bubbles (element kind).
    The radial menu and all UI chrome are ACHROMATIC (translucent graphite + white
    glyphs), so chrome never reads as a kind hue. Highlight/selection uses a
    reserved white→cyan channel only.
  text: |
    A 1:1 (square) first-person VR mockup: a radial command menu summoned over a
    3D bubble-view code space.

    SCENE / BACKGROUND:
    - Dark graphite volumetric VR space (#15181C) with soft depth haze; a field of
      packed-sphere "bubbles" floats ahead, colored STRICTLY by the Okabe-Ito kind
      palette with distinct silhouettes: translucent frosted slate Package
      (#6E7B8B) containing children, solid blue Class (#0072B2), sky banded
      Interface (#56B4E9), orange faceted Enum (#E69F00), teal polar-cap Struct
      (#009E73), small green Function (#2CA02C). A few crisp SDF labels on the
      nearest bubbles. One bubble ray-targeted with a white→cyan rim.
    - Two VR controllers visible in the lower frame (clean modern matte controllers),
      a thin aiming RAY projecting from the dominant hand toward the bubbles.

    THE RADIAL MENU (centerpiece, wrist-anchored to the dominant controller,
    facing the user, translucent graphite, NO kind colors):
    - A circular pie menu with SIX primary sectors in ring 1, each a single white
      monochrome glyph + tiny label, evenly spaced at thumbstick positions:
        Add (＋ over a bubble) · Connect (two dots + line) · Delete (trash) ·
        Undo (↶) · Redo (↷) · Project→2D (bubble→rectangle).
    - The CENTER hub reads "Select / cancel" (the home state).
    - ONE sector is highlighted (Add) with a white→cyan glow to show the
      thumbstick is pointing at it — about to confirm with the trigger.
    - A SECOND, CONTEXT ring fans out from the highlighted Add sector: a small
      arc of kind options as their §2.1-colored kind glyphs (○ Package, ● Class,
      ◐ Interface, ⬢ Enum, ◑ Struct) — the only place color appears in the menu,
      because those swatches preview the bubble kind. Max depth = 2 rings.
    - The menu has a soft floating drop shadow and gentle translucency so the
      bubble field is still visible behind it. Comfortable near-field scale.

    OVERALL:
    - Mood: immersive but calm, premium XR productivity tool. Crisp SDF glyphs
      that stay sharp at angle/depth. Achromatic menu, colorful bubbles.
    - No game UI, no neon, no busy particle effects.
  provider_options:
    aspect_ratio: "1:1"
    style: "natural"

output:
  formats:
    - format: png
  dimensions:
    width: 1440
    height: 1440
    aspect_ratio: "1:1"

eval:
  pass_threshold: 0.72
  criteria:
    radial_structure: {weight: 3, description: "Six-sector ring-1 (Add/Connect/Delete/Undo/Redo/Project) with a Select center hub; one sector highlighted; a depth-2 context ring of kind glyphs fanning from Add"}
    reserved_channel: {weight: 3, description: "Radial menu + chrome are achromatic graphite/white; highlight is white→cyan; the ONLY color in the menu is the kind-swatch context ring; no sector tinted as a random kind hue"}
    vr_context: {weight: 2, description: "Believable first-person VR: controllers + aiming ray + wrist-anchored near-field menu over a dark volumetric bubble field"}
    bubble_fidelity: {weight: 2, description: "Background bubbles use correct Okabe-Ito hues + distinct silhouettes; one ray-targeted with white→cyan rim"}
  reject_if:
    - "menu sectors colored with kind/rainbow hues (only the kind-swatch ring may be colored)"
    - "game-style or neon HUD aesthetic"
    - "flat 2D screenshot with no VR depth or controllers"
    - "more than two radial rings (over-deep menu)"

tags: [trd, authoring-ux, vr, xr, radial-menu, bubble-view, uml, mockup]
